language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

contract PhysicalSerialContract.
interface PhysicalSerialInterface.
message-set CapturedSerialBytes.

PhysicalSerialInterface follows PhysicalSerialContract.
PhysicalSerialContract allows CapturedSerialBytes.
PhysicalSerialContract specifies "Design boundary for passive byte observation only in this exercise. No physical write endpoint is enabled.".
PhysicalSerialContract status proposed.
CapturedSerialBytes describes "PhysicalSerial incoming message family; exact allowed variants follow the cited schema or the associated contract gap.".
